, effects & presets\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd29Cartoon Photo Editor\r\n-Create cartoon version of yourself in one tap with this pro AI photo editor in seconds\r\n-If you would like to swap your face into an Anime/Disney character, try this cartoon photo editor to instantly transform photos\r\n-Generate custom avatars using our pro AI photo editor\r\n\r\n\ud83e\uddfcRemove Unwanted Objects\r\n- Clean up pictures & remove unwanted objects with the Object Removal tool\r\n- Remove watermark and logos from images\r\n- Remove the background from photos & swap it with your favorite background presets to bring more attention to the subject of images\r\n- Erase sticker/unwanted text from photos\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf24Sky Changer\r\n- Replace the background in photos with a brand-new sky\r\n- With one tap, you can darken the background/change the background with a new sky\r\n- Make the subject in images pop with the pro sky changer which offers many sky presets\r\n- PhotoShot Photo Editor Pro has 50+ high-quality sky backgrounds\r\n\r\n\ud83d\uddbcBackground Eraser & Background Changer\r\n-Auto cut out photos, remove & change the background of photos & create high-quality PNG images that are pixel-level accurate\r\n-Seamlessly combine cutout photos with creative background templates & presets\r\n-Apply 100+ 2D, 3D custom created trending backgrounds\r\n-Get a Transparent background PNG picture\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc57Clothes Changer\r\n-Change the color of clothes with PhotoShot Photo Editor Pro\r\n-Choose from a variety of designs & aesthetic patterns\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc51Photo Blender & Light FX\r\n- Overlays: PhotoShot Photo Editor is the simplest & easiest way to blend two pictures\r\n-Create double/multi-exposure images by blending/mixing photos to make stunning artwork & let your creativity run wild with this Photo Editor Pro\r\n\r\n\u2728Blur Photo Editor\r\n- Edit photos with this must-have free photo editor\r\n- Advanced blur photo brush\r\n- Blur photo background to get DSLR Blur Phot